// @requirement: B.1.2.5 -- c) When used in templates or template fields of charstring or universal charstring types, the boundaries shall evaluate to valid character positions according to the coded character set table(s) of the type (e.g. the given position shall not be empty).
// @id: TTCN3-CORE-B.1.2.5-008a
